OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd isolated shower is
OL,6,Fpossible but for the most part it will
OL,7,Fstay dry with variable cloud allowing
OL,8,Fbright or sunny intervals. Fresh
OL,9,Fnortheasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with variable
OL,12,Fcloud and some clear intervals.
OL,13,FOvernight staying mostly dry with
OL,14,Fclear intervals but the odd shower
OL,15,Fpossible from the north. Fresh
OL,16,Fnortheasterly winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FCloudy at times with bright
OL,19,For sunny spells interspersed with some
OL,20,Fscattered showers from the north.
OL,21,FFresh northeasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
